@* The way out of a reference sheet to the Spirit Island wiki's page on the same subject — the
   sheet summarises, the wiki has the full rules text. Sits last in the body on the three sheets
   that offer it, each of which used to spell the row out itself. *@

<div class="pt-2">
    @* The tones are the base stylesheet's for any link, so only the layout is said here. *@
    <a href="@GameLookups.WikiLink(Name)" target="_blank" rel="noopener"
       class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-sm">
        Read on the Spirit Island wiki
        <Icon Name="arrow-right" Class="w-3.5 h-3.5"/>
    </a>
</div>

@code {
    /// <summary>The subject's display name, which is how the wiki names its pages.</summary>
    [Parameter, EditorRequired] public string Name { get; set; } = "";
}
